      "text": "HT-18\nVigilant Eagles\nNAS WHITING FIELD, FL\n\u201cWARRIORS TRAIN HERE\u201d\nSunday, 15-Nov-2026\nHT-18 KEY CONTACTS: HT-18 KEY PERSONNEL:\nSDO DUTY OFFICE (850) 623-7478/7477 CMEO LT KEOHANE\nSDO CELL PHONE (850) 449-1842 SPC LT GRZESIAK\nFDO CELL PHONE (850) 450-4771 SAPR LT DAVIDSON / LT CROSSNO / AWS1 LESTER\nDOD SAFE HELPLINE (877) 995-5247 AT/FP LT SMITH\nNASWF SAPR VA (24/7) (850) 554-5383 DAPA LT COOK\nHT-18 OMBUDSMAN (443) 852-4352 SEA AWS1 LESTER\nSUNRISE: 0614 / SUNSET: 1651 EENT: 1745 MOONRISE: 1129 / MOONSET: 2207 % ILLUM: 29% LOW LIGHT LEVEL: 2214-0509\nTOTAL FLY EVENTS: 20 ADVANCING X\u2019s: 19 TOTAL FLY HRS: 39.0 TOTAL SIM EVENTS: 0 TOTAL SIM HRS: 0.0\nEP: MISCOMPARE OF SECONDARY PARAMETERS (ASTERISK)\nNATOPS: What does the N1 drivetrain power?\nDUTY/WATCH ASSIGNED SIGN IN SIGN OUT\nCDO EDWARDS, COLLIN M, LT 0700 2100\nAM SDO CARL, NICHOLAS S, 1stLt 0600 1800\nPM SDO ERICSON, NICHOLAS F, 2ndLt 1800 0600\nDUTY DRIVER WARD, BRADEN T, ENS 0730 1600\nDAILY EVENTS\n1) FIELD HOURS: KNDZ CTO: 0700-1600 & 1700-2100 / RECOVERY WINDOW: 1700-2100 / FUEL: CLOSED\nUPCOMING EVENTS\nOLF HOURS FUEL\n1) 16-20 NOV: AIRDALES GAS MASK FITTING / ALL USMC\nSPENCER CLOSED\n2) WALK-IN MASK FITTING: ALL USN & USAF @ BLDG 2994 RM 3 / 0800-1600\nPACE CLOSED\n3) 25 NOV: SAFETY STAND DOWN\nSITE X CLOSED\n4) THANKSGIVING 96: 26-29NOV / NO FLIGHTS/SIMS/ACADEMICS\nSANTA ROSA CLOSED\nSTANDING NOTES\nCHOCTAW CLOSED\n1) ASAPS ARE ENCOURAGED FOR EVERY FLIGHT AND REQUIRED FOR NOTEWORTHY EVENTS;\nHAROLD CLOSED\nASAP LINK: HTTPS://ASAP.SAFETY.AF.MIL/#/\n2) THE SQUADRON ANYMOUSE BOX IS LOCATED IN ROOM 37A IN THE JMPS PLANNING SPACES.\n3) BASE OPS EMAIL: cnic_se_whtg_baseops@us.navy.mil\n4) TO RECEIVE CREDIT FOR CAIs IN TSHARP, THE STUDENT MUST LAUNCH THE COURSE THROUGH THEIR GRADEBOOK.\n5) STUDENTS SHALL KEEP THEIR NMCI ACCOUNTS CURRENT BY LOGGING INTO AN NMCI\nMACHINE AT LEAST ONCE EVERY 30 DAYS.\n6) SNIVELS SHALL BE IN TSHARP NLT 0800, THREE WORKING DAYS PRIOR TO THE DATE OF THE\nSNIV. LATE SNIVS REQUIRE A TSHARP ENTRY AND THEN A FACE-TO-FACE MEETING WITH THE FDO.\n7) ALL HANDS WILL CONDUCT PT IN ACCORDANCE WITH OPNAVINST6110.1L (DATED 29DEC2025).\nSAFETY OFFICER OPERATIONS OFFICER EXECUTIVE OFFICER COMMANDING OFFICER\nLCDR ISBELL LCDR MERRITT COL PIANTANIDA CDR VIGER"
